327	    /**
328	     * Check whether an email's domain is on the disposable-domain blocklist. The domain is the text
329	     * after the last {@code '@'}, compared case-insensitively against {@link #DISPOSABLE_EMAIL_DOMAINS}.
330	     * This is the single source of truth for which email domains are rejected, shared by any
331	     * persistence path. A {@code null} or empty email, or one with no {@code '@'}, is not disposable.
