979	    /**
980	     * The canonical regions treated as {@code METRO} by {@link #ownerSegment()}: a locality is a
981	     * known region exactly when it is {@code NSW}, {@code VIC} or {@code QLD}. Any other locality
982	     * (including {@code 'UNKNOWN'}) is {@code REGIONAL}.
