77	     * Threshold of owners already in an owner's city (compared case-insensitively) at or above which
78	     * a newly created owner is flagged with {@code capacityWarning} to signal the city is approaching
79	     * the {@link #MAX_OWNERS_PER_CITY} hard limit. A city that already contains between this many and
80	     * {@code MAX_OWNERS_PER_CITY - 1} owners warns; reaching {@code MAX_OWNERS_PER_CITY} is rejected.
81	     */
82	    static final int CAPACITY_WARNING_THRESHOLD = 40;
83	
84	    /**
85	     * Maximum number of owners that may be registered on a single day. Creating an owner on a day
